# 调试工作流：简单例子 → 出错打印 scheme trace → trace 跟踪调用
wait 2.5
type (+ 1 2 3)
key enter
wait 0.7
type (define (f x) (+ x (g x)))
key enter
wait 0.7
type (define (g y) (car y))
key enter
wait 0.7
type (f 1)
key enter
wait 1.5
type (trace 'f)
key enter
wait 0.6
type (f 2)
key enter
wait 1.5
type (exit)
key enter
